<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1698244260"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:36.000"><div begin="14.726" end="32.975" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.726" end="19.888" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.726" end="15.629">如果</span><span begin="15.629" end="15.958">离</span><span begin="15.958" end="16.554">别</span><span begin="16.554" end="17.452">是为</span><span begin="17.452" end="18.065">了</span><span begin="18.065" end="18.734">能再</span><span begin="18.734" end="19.147">见</span><span begin="19.147" end="19.448">一</span><span begin="19.448" end="19.888">面</span></p><p begin="21.187" end="25.570" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.187" end="21.589">爱</span><span begin="21.589" end="21.873">是</span><span begin="21.873" end="22.351">想</span><span begin="22.351" end="22.929">念</span><span begin="22.929" end="23.421">后</span><span begin="23.421" end="23.672">的</span><span begin="23.672" end="24.155">抛</span><span begin="24.155" end="24.391">物</span><span begin="24.391" end="25.570">线</span></p><p begin="26.611" end="32.975" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.611" end="27.649">离开始</span><span begin="27.649" end="27.944">渐</span><span begin="27.944" end="28.851">行渐</span><span begin="28.851" end="29.305">远</span> <span begin="29.511" end="31.161">和我们总是</span><span begin="31.161" end="31.765">擦</span><span begin="31.765" end="32.975">肩</span></p></div><div begin="37.639" end="57.527" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="37.639" end="42.982" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.639" end="38.718">这次再</span><span begin="38.718" end="39.468">见</span><span begin="39.468" end="40.034">如果</span><span begin="40.034" end="40.807">是</span><span begin="40.807" end="41.620">最后</span><span begin="41.620" end="42.007">的</span><span begin="42.007" end="42.982">一面</span></p><p begin="44.013" end="48.551" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.013" end="45.165">也是失</span><span begin="45.165" end="45.763">眠</span><span begin="45.763" end="46.257">后</span><span begin="46.257" end="47.223">的分割</span><span begin="47.223" end="48.551">线</span></p><p begin="49.338" end="57.527" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.338" end="50.470">春天已</span><span begin="50.470" end="51.107">开始</span><span begin="51.107" end="51.664">落</span><span begin="51.664" end="52.088">叶</span> <span begin="52.318" end="54.034">七月里也会</span><span begin="54.034" end="54.432">下</span><span begin="54.432" end="57.527">雪</span></p></div><div begin="58.726" end="1:42.199" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.726" end="1:04.935" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.726" end="59.772">刚刚我</span><span begin="59.772" end="1:01.287">错过的大</span><span begin="1:01.287" end="1:01.965">雨</span> <span begin="1:02.280" end="1:02.984">握不</span><span begin="1:02.984" end="1:03.433">住</span><span begin="1:03.433" end="1:04.057">的盛</span><span begin="1:04.057" end="1:04.935">夏</span></p><p begin="1:05.171" end="1:10.529" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.171" end="1:06.022">飘过</span><span begin="1:06.022" end="1:06.560">的云</span><span begin="1:06.560" end="1:07.381">是你</span><span begin="1:07.381" end="1:07.821">吗</span> <span begin="1:07.821" end="1:07.983">一</span><span begin="1:07.983" end="1:08.932">圈又</span><span begin="1:08.932" end="1:09.505">一</span><span begin="1:09.505" end="1:10.529">圈</span></p><p begin="1:10.895" end="1:21.220" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.895" end="1:11.899">我多想</span><span begin="1:11.899" end="1:12.590">是路</span><span begin="1:12.590" end="1:13.370">过</span><span begin="1:13.370" end="1:13.872">你的</span><span begin="1:13.872" end="1:14.563">风</span> <span begin="1:14.876" end="1:15.221">忍</span><span begin="1:15.221" end="1:15.433">不</span><span begin="1:15.433" end="1:16.191">住</span><span begin="1:16.191" end="1:16.950">落回</span><span begin="1:16.950" end="1:17.396">你</span><span begin="1:17.396" end="1:17.797">眼</span><span begin="1:17.797" end="1:21.220">中<